<title>BOTSWANA: PRESS DIGEST - Botswana - Feb 5.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Botswana - Feb 5.</headline>
<dateline>GABORONE 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in Botswana's independent midweek newspaper, The Gazette, on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>- The House of Chiefs has supported proposals to limit the president's term of office to two terms, but has rejected suggestions that the vice president should automatically succeed the president.</p>
<p>- A delegation of 20 French businessmen is due to arrive in Gaborone next week.</p>
<p>-- Gaborone newsroom (+267) 347182.</p>
